{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"(This is a chat where the DMs can talk to a player's spirit.  The player will not be able to read the message history here, so grant the player in question the permission to use this chat so you can talk to them, and then remove said permission when they have been brought back.  This can also be used for any other DM-Player, hidden from the rest of the player base conversations, for instance when I am damning people.\n\nThese track as IC channels, due to many of the events that happen here will blend OOC and IC)","created_at":"2021-07-01T17:08:42.570000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"860205288292089857","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"<@!740639937677754539> You awaken in a garden with the sound of waves surrounding you. Gaillardia, a dryad, sits on a bench before you patting the seat next to her. \"Come sit, we have much to discuss,, I'll pour you some tea.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T05:58:06.040000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865109954170716191","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"Meorys takes a sit, and looks around at her surroundings. \"Thank you.\" And sips from the tea. \"I'm dead again, aren't I?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:14:14.562000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865114016446677003","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Not for long hopefully, but yes dear.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:17:30.787000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865114839475159060","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
