{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"The tea tastes like the color pink.","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:17:56.997000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865114949407866890","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Yeah it, is. You know this is my second time dying this week? I thought life here was just easy. But now I'm finding trouble I can't get out of.\" She fiddles with the cup.","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:20:06.823000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865115493936922664","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Yes, this week has been much busier than usual. War tends to send more to deaths door.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:21:09.044000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865115754911498262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"You are here because your friends brought your body to me and wish you to come back, they will gather the necessary spell components, but you will have to pay the real cost. We must make a deal. I will not force you into anything, we can negotiate, I want your consent and choice in this.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:24:32.062000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865116606429265940","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Well... what do I have to give?\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:28:49.319000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865117685444116500","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Oh many things! you are so full of wonderful qualities!\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:39:43.172000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865120427902107649","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"D (they/them)","id":"692746345387130900","is_bot":0,"username":"nonbianarydarry"},"author_id":"692746345387130900","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Skills and talents, memories and lifespan, there are many acceptable offerings\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:40:54.783000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865120728259756032","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"chinea","id":"740639937677754539","is_bot":0,"username":"franczine"},"author_id":"740639937677754539","channel_id":"860204985325322261","content":"\"Uhh... I don;t think I can give you any skills. With the war in the Empire, I think I''ll need them. \" She thinks for a second. \"I- I think I can give you some years of my life, tho.\"","created_at":"2021-07-15T06:43:33.767000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"865121395087376414","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
